 "description": "\n <ul>\n  <li>Promotes Dental Health – Designed with bristle grooves, this chew stick works like a toothbrush. Add dog toothpaste into the grooves, and as your pet chews, it helps clean teeth, reduce plaque, and support healthy gums.</li>\n  <li>Durable &amp; Safe Material – Made of bite resistant TPR material, strong enough for aggressive chewers. Tough yet gentle on teeth, it keeps dogs entertained while supporting daily dental care.</li>\n  <li>Almost Indestructible - The indestructible dog chew toys Tested and approved by many aggressive chewers. While no dog toy is truly indestructible, but this dog chew toy comes very close.</li>\n  <li>Anxiety &amp; Boredom Relief - Keep your dog mentally stimulated and emotionally balanced with this engaging chew toy. Perfect for relieving anxiety, reducing destructive behavior, and offering enrichment to tire out your pup. The toy also protects furniture and shoes by redirecting chewing behavior to a durable and safe alternative.</li>\n  <li>Suitable for All Dog Sizes: Whether you have a small teething puppy, a medium-sized dog, or a large breed, this toy is ideal for all sizes. It’s designed to meet the needs of dogs weighing from 10 to 90 lbs while also being light enough for teething puppies. A perfect choice for training, dental care, and overall happiness.<br><p><b>Product material: TPR</b></p><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/d512aed2-0667-4697-b062-0169c01bea0b.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/68bb1e11-e60c-48b6-8903-ec07d6dd8d27.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></li>\n </ul>\n",
